            "answer": {
              "short": "Two irrational solutions.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=3^2-4(-2)(7)\\\\\\Delta&=9+56\\\\\\Delta&=65\\end{align*}$$\n$65>0$ and is not a perfect square, so there are two irrational solutions.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 36
          }
